Your post indicates that you are not aware of the '-u' parameter.

For example, if you polymorph into 'Troffymoff', you restart the
game with the right save file by entering:

nethack -uTroffymoff

Easy as cheese.. and remember, if everything else fails, not 
including posting on News, you could always read the manual..

